What:		/sys/bus/platform/drivers/qcom_glink_shmem/<dev>/{rx_head,rx_tail,tx_head,tx_tail}
Date:		September 2026
KernelVersion:	7.3
Contact:	Brian Cain <brian.cain@oss.qualcomm.com>
Description:
		The head and tail of the FIFO this side of a GLINK link over
		shared memory reads from (rx) and writes to (tx).  A tail
		that is not at the head is data that its reader has not taken.

